Music Assistant changes to libraop's src/rtsp_client.c, against the pinned
submodule commit. The build applies this to a copy of the file (see the
Makefile).

A failed connect closes its socket. Left open, the cleanup after it sends
FLUSH and TEARDOWN on a socket that never connected and waits 10 s for
each answer.

Only one request and its answer run on the connection at a time. libraop's
control thread sends its keepalive on the connection the caller's own thread
uses for volume, metadata, artwork and FLUSH. Left to overlap, each thread
reads parts of the other's answer, and one request can land in the middle of
another's body.

